        },
        {
            "_id": "PgK6G5QsHGnCu9S6",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Hardlight Projection",
            "sort": 800000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The node projects a new Huge, insect-like form around itself, changing its appearance but not its statistics. The node's projected form is a solid body made of hardlight. While using a projected form, the node's true form, a Tiny gem, is always visible embedded in the projection's abdomen or thorax. The gemstone is the facetal's sensory organ, and if the gemstone is covered, the facetal node is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded].</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "concentrate",
                        "light",
                        "polymorph",
                        "primal"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "xFKazim15tV9Jn1H",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Temporal Skip",
            "sort": 900000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The facetal branch can pluck creatures from the very flow of time. One creature the branch can see within 30 feet must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:40] save. The branch can target themself, automatically failing their save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and becomes temporarily immune to Temporal Skip for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature winks out of existence for 1 round (or for up to 1 hour if the branch targeted themself). Until the creature reappears, time doesn't pass for the creature. When the effect ends, the creature returns to the space it occupied when it disappeared or to the nearest space if the original is now filled.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "concentrate",
                        "incapacitation",
                        "primal"
                    ]
                }
            },
